## Authentication routes

### Login
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "ayman2@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Register
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "ayman",
  "email": "ayman2@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "phone": "29932929",
  "roleId": 1
}


### Logout
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/logout
Content-Type: application/json